  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of the 16th-Century Wat Xieng Thong in Luang Prabang, Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The coronation temple of Lao kings from the mid-16th century until the 1970s, Wat Xieng Thong requires immediate conservation attention to reverse the destructive effects of decades of neglect and increased visitation and use. Phase 3 of this on-going project involves the preservation of supporting structures and several stupas within the complex.</narrative>
  </description>
